# Pinned cloudflared release for `scripts/demo.sh --phone` (T-1108c).
#
# The demo runs only a cloudflared whose `--version` reports this release and
# whose SHA-256 matches the artefact below for the machine's architecture. A
# binary that is unpinned, a different version, or a hash mismatch is refused
# before it is ever executed, so a tampered or unexpected tunnel binary cannot
# be launched (review finding F2).
#
# Hashes are the SHA-256 of the official Linux release artefacts:
#   https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/releases/download/2026.10.0/<artefact>
#
# Format: `version <tag>` and `sha256 <artefact> <hex>`, one per line.
version 2026.10.0
sha256 linux-amd64 d33ff2d14475178d2012c2c56beba87389ac5ded27649519f198a7d3134a99db
sha256 linux-arm64 e6422b9d4f72d3194bc5a38676f13667c06666523217b842a877d72a80b5ac08
